# One device, two boot interfaces on one slot, and the keyboard NEVER
# typed on: its pump sits armed, polling the shared slot every loop
# iteration. Eight pointer samples 400 ms apart; if any completion is
# consumed by the wrong endpoint's wait and lost, the mouse freezes
# before reaching (80,40).
-hid-combo -hid-nak-unchanged -mouse 2500:10,40,0;2900:20,40,0;3300:30,40,0;3700:40,40,0;4100:50,40,0;4500:60,40,0;4900:70,40,0;5300:80,40,1
